@overheard deck5
// Writer 5, batch 7. Deck 5 off duty: the tea corner at half ten, the Works bay after shift, main storage, the
// shuttle bay window, the lift club. At most one in five about work. Lines naming a crew member keep that person out.

== overheard
? pair:works+works place:teacorner time:morning
A: Ten twenty-nine.
B: Kettle's ready.
A: Ten thirty. Pour.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:teague-theo with:halloran-emeka place:teacorner
A: I've drawn the Chief as a cloud again.
B: A tidy cloud?
A: The tidiest. She says "Fair."   #funny

? pair:any+any who:rahman-farah with:eklund-leila place:teacorner
A: Star three hundred and ninety-nine.
B: You're nearly there.
A: I'm saving the four hundredth.

? pair:any+any who:eklund-leila with:amadi-asha place:teacorner
A: Gran sent the one about the goat again.
B: The goat song?
A: Four verses. The goat wins.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:halloran-emeka place:teacorner
A: Why did the spanner stop for tea?
B: Don't.
A: It needed a brake.   #funny

? pair:works+works place:worksbay time:evening
A: Shift's done. Why are we still here?
B: It's warm. The chairs are good.
A: There aren't any chairs.
B: The crates are good.   #funny

? pair:works+any place:worksbay time:evening !who:calder !with:calder
A: Don't sit on the blue crate.
B: Whose is it?
A: Calder's. Nobody knows why.

? pair:any+any who:rossi-femi with:silva-bea place:worksbay time:evening weekday:tue
A: It's Tuesday. I've called home.
B: How's everyone?
A: Loud. All of them. Same as ever.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:moreau-signe with:achterberg-lars deck:5 time:evening
A: Lars, the last page is missing again.
B: It's better that way.
A: It's a mystery. I need the end.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:main_storage
A: Who keeps moving the good tape?
B: Nobody. It walks.
A: It's walked to Deck 3 twice.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:quist-ilse with:pell place:main_storage time:afternoon
A: Pell. You're asleep on the spare filters.
B: Resting my eyes. On the filters.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:amadi-asha place:shuttle_bay
A: Best window on Deck 5, this.
B: It looks at the Tern.
A: Past the Tern. Look further.

? pair:any+any place:shuttle_bay time:evening
A: She looks small, the Tern.
B: She felt big, coming in.
A: Everything does, the first day.   #warm

? pair:any+any deck:5 who:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove|keane-davi with:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove|keane-davi
A: Lovely lift.
B: Lovely lift.
A: Lovely. Yes. Lovely.   #funny
